  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that the RNA-only singleprofile baseline (config_001) achieves 0.4849 validation accuracy. The uncertainty lies in whether multiprofile settings improve performance when using the same RNA encoder (pca_n2000). This experiment tests the effect of profile setting (singleprofile vs multiprofile) while keeping RNA encoder, image encoder, and aggregation method constant. It isolates the impact of profile setting, which is a critical design choice, and provides direct evidence to guide future decisions about modality and profile interactions."
